WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hi, this is my Bank Management System.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
It is a console application that lets users open accounts, deposit funds, and handle transactions.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Here I open a new account.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Now I make a deposit, and you can see the transaction log update.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
I built it with the skills I learned at Addis Ababa Science and Technology University.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Thanks for watching.
